@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Crear Grupo (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectId": "SUBJECT_UUID_HERE",
  "periodId": "PERIOD_UUID_HERE",
  "groupCode": "1301",
  "capacity": 40
}

### Listar Grupos
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Consultar Mis Grupos (Alumno autenticado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections/my-sections
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Agregar Horario a Grupo (Admin / Profesor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections/SECTION_UUID_HERE/meetings
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weekday": 1,
  "startTime": "07:00",
  "endTime": "09:00",
  "room": "A-101"
}

### Unirse a un Grupo con Código (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections/join
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "joinCode": "JOIN_CODE_HERE"
}

